# Strength of Will {1}{G}: "Until end of turn, target creature you control gains indestructible and 'Whenever this creature is dealt damage, put that many +1/+1 counters on it.'"
# Only a creature you control can be the target: Bot2's Grizzly Bears and Bot1's own Mox Emerald are refused. On turn 3 Bot1 gives its Grizzly Bears (2/2) the
# gift and Bot2 Lightning Bolts it: three damage on a 2/2 would kill it, but it is indestructible and gets exactly three +1/+1 counters, a 5/5 with
# 3 damage marked. On turn 4 the effect has ended: one Bolt makes no more counters (still 5/5), and a second Bolt, 6 damage in all, kills it.

